## Exact extracted preflight execution

The script at lines 130-154 of `candidate-claude-code-review.r5.yml` was extracted without modification. Its output and summary files were under `/private/tmp/r18-preflight.togq31`, outside the repository.

```text
$ env -i ... bash -c "$preflight_script"                    # no credential
::notice title=Claude review not configured::No Claude credential is set, so the review job is skipped. This is not an error.
credential=none
exit=0
### Claude review skipped — no credential configured
The review job did not run because no Claude credential is set.
Set **one** of the two shapes, not both:
- Static credential: repository secret `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`, or `CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN` from `claude setup-token`.
- Workload identity federation: repository variables `ANTHROPIC_FEDERATION_RULE_ID` and `ANTHROPIC_ORGANIZATION_ID` (and optionally `ANTHROPIC_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_ID`).
If you do not want AI review on this repository, delete `.github/workflows/claude-code-review.yml`.

$ env -i ... ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=present bash -c "$preflight_script"
Claude credential shape detected: static
credential=static
exit=0
$ env -i ... ANTHROPIC_FEDERATION_RULE_ID=rule ANTHROPIC_ORGANIZATION_ID=organization bash -c "$preflight_script"
Claude credential shape detected: federation
credential=federation
exit=0
